	l > u / o_{t,d}#
	i:[+ long] y:[+ long] > ɛi œy
	u:[+ long] > ʌu
	# Hard-vs.-soft-G phenomena:
	x ɣ > {x,χ} {ɣ,x,χ}
	x ɣ > ç ʝ